spans.s:
1. भा cl. 2. P. (Dhātup. xxiv, 43) भा॑ति (pr. p. भात् f. भान्ती or भाती, Vop.; Pot. भायात्, TBr.; pl. बभौ, Mn.; MBh. &c.; aor. अभासीत् Gr. Bhaṭṭ.; fut. भास्य॑ति, Br. &c.),
to shine, be bright or luminous, RV. &c. &c.;
to shine forth, appear, show one's self, ib.;
to be splendid or beautiful or eminent, MBh.; Kāv. &c. (with न, to cut a poor figure, Kathās.);
to appear as, seem, look like, pass for (nom. with or without इव adv. in वत्), MBh.; Kāv. &c.;
to be, exist, W.;
to show, exhibit, manifest, Bhaṭṭ. (v.l.) :
Pass. भायते, impers. radiance is put forth by (instr.), Bhaṭṭ. :
Caus. भापयते;
 aor. अबीभपत् Gr.:
Desid. बिभासति, ib. :
Intens. बाभायते, बाभेति, बाभाति, ib.
